  "description": "上百年来，地球人被反复告知维生素 C（VC）的重要性，然而最近我却越来越怀疑它。",
  "body_html": "<p>上百年来，地球人被反复告知维生素 C（VC）的重要性，然而最近我却越来越怀疑它。</p><div class=\"captioned-image-container\"><figure><a class=\"image-link image2 is-viewable-img\" target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Vsvq!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa2aa7296-824a-42a5-914f-26fa01d39ea8_400x603.jpeg\" data-component-name=\"Image2ToDOM\"><div class=\"image2-inset\"><picture><source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Vsvq!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa2aa7296-824a-42a5-914f-26fa01d39ea8_400x603.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Vsvq!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa2aa7296-824a-42a5-914f-26fa01d39ea8_400x603.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Vsvq!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa2aa7296-824a-42a5-914f-26fa01d39ea8_400x603.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Vsvq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa2aa7296-824a-42a5-914f-26fa01d39ea8_400x603.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Vsvq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa2aa7296-824a-42a5-914f-26fa01d39ea8_400x603.jpeg\" width=\"400\" height=\"603\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/a2aa7296-824a-42a5-914f-26fa01d39ea8_400x603.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:603,&quot;width&quot;:400,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:56264,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://yinwang1.substack.com/i/208003200?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa2aa7296-824a-42a5-914f-26fa01d39ea8_400x603.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}\" class=\"sizing-normal\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Vsvq!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa2aa7296-824a-42a5-914f-26fa01d39ea8_400x603.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Vsvq!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa2aa7296-824a-42a5-914f-26fa01d39ea8_400x603.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Vsvq!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa2aa7296-824a-42a5-914f-26fa01d39ea8_400x603.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!Vsvq!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fa2aa7296-824a-42a5-914f-26fa01d39ea8_400x603.jpeg 1456w\" sizes=\"100vw\" fetchpriority=\"high\"></picture><div class=\"image-link-expand\"><div class=\"pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset\"><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"var(--color-fg-primary)\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><g><path d=\"M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882\"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex=\"0\" type=\"button\" class=\"pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2\"><polyline points=\"15 3 21 3 21 9\"></polyline><polyline points=\"9 21 3 21 3 15\"></polyline><line x1=\"21\" x2=\"14\" y1=\"3\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"3\" x2=\"10\" y1=\"21\" y2=\"14\"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>上图是一个朋友发给我的关于 VC 功能的宣传。看似非常吸引人，但这里面有几个是真的，有哪些只是谣言？这就是我怀疑 VC 的原因之一。</p><p>当然，我不是说你不应该吃含 VC 的食物。实际上，你想要专吃不含 VC 的食物都很难，以至于普通人非常难缺乏 VC。这就是我怀疑 VC 的原因之二。</p><p>我怀疑关于 VC 功能的夸大和宣传，对每日 VC 需求量的夸大，对人们补充 VC 的鼓动（甚至恐吓）。</p><p>所有这些误导，驱动着一些人刻意地，“海量”地补充 VC。不是从天然食物，而是服用化工生产的 VC 片剂。其他人也把 VC 作为了一种无害的必需品对待。他们对于各种包装食品和饮料里添加的 VC（化工合成）视而不见，习以为常。</p><h1>从 VC 的发现说起</h1><p>从小我…</p>",
